        "content": [
          {
            "content": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<h2>1. Predict the greedy match</h2><p>Compare possible endings before checking. A dot can match a bracket as well as a letter.</p><p>Predict first. With a partner, alternate explaining and checking; alone, write your reasoning before choosing Check.</p>"
              },
              "subContentId": "b017c3c4-9d0c-4d3b-82a5-ef0175064ad3",
              "metadata": {
                "title": "1. Define the result",
                "license": "U",
                "authors": [],
                "changes": [],
                "contentType": "Text"
              }
            },
            "useSeparator": "disabled"
          },
          {
            "content": {
              "library": "H5P.MultiChoice 1.16",
              "params": {
                "media": {
                  "disableImageZooming": false
                },
                "answers": [
                  {
                    "text": "<code>&lt;red&gt;</code>",
                    "correct": false,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "This would be the result with &lt;.*?&gt;. Here, .* is greedy and can include the first &gt; and the text after it.",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<code>&lt;red&gt; and &lt;blue&gt;</code>",
                    "correct": true,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "The match starts at the first &lt;. Greedy .* tries more repetitions first, then gives back characters so the final &gt; can match. The match ends at the last &gt;.",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<code>&lt;blue&gt;</code>",
                    "correct": false,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "re.search() finds a match beginning at the earlier &lt;. Greedy does not mean choose the last opening bracket.",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<code>A &lt;red&gt; and &lt;blue&gt; balloon.</code>",
                    "correct": false,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "The pattern requires the match to begin with &lt; and end with &gt;. Text outside those boundaries is not included.",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "overallFeedback": [
                  {
                    "from": 0,
                    "to": 100
                  }
                ],
