                "question": "<h3>Predict and explain</h3><p>What does this code return?</p><pre><code>text = 'A &lt;red&gt; and &lt;blue&gt; balloon.'\nre.search(r\"&lt;.*&gt;\", text).group()</code></pre><p></p>"
