                "text": "<h2>4. Choose for a goal</h2><p>Use the desired output to choose a pattern. Explain why another pattern would include too much.</p><p>Predict first. With a partner, alternate explaining and checking; alone, write your reasoning before choosing Check.</p>"
              },
