                "text": "<h2>5. Check a missing boundary</h2><p>Test whether your explanation still works when a required character is absent.</p><p>Predict first. With a partner, alternate explaining and checking; alone, write your reasoning before choosing Check.</p>"
              },
              "subContentId": "d89ac48f-5b47-4e1a-9821-0bf835c8a99d",
